From 8e0310f06604f5464b70bd1ab39b46d9d29e2a4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:14:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1022/1022] SableOS: Photos keys in the viewer, the grid and
 the albums list

Wire the Photos keyboard model into Glimpse:

* Viewer (ViewActivity.dispatchKeyEvent): Left/Right and J/K move
  between items through the existing navigate path; Space plays or
  pauses a video and pages photos; + / - zoom the shown photo one step
  through the zoom engine (ZoomableEngine.scale, animated) and 0 fits
  it again; I opens the info sheet, S share and F favorite run the
  on-screen buttons (keyguard dismissal included), only when shown.
* Delete asks first: D or Del opens the existing Move to trash dialog
  (Delete forever on a trashed item) instead of trashing at once, and
  does nothing on a read-only item.
* Grid (AlbumFragment, via a key listener on each thumbnail): Space
  opens the focused item like Enter, D or Del delete the selection or
  the focused item after the same dialogs, S shares them. Not while
  picking.
* Albums (AlbumsFragment): typing letters or digits moves focus to
  the album whose name starts with them; Space opens the album.

Touch, selection and media access are unchanged; Back and Esc keep
their meaning (leave the viewer, close the album). Focus stays visible
through the Sable focus ring of patch 0801.
